BreezeTTS is a Swift and Metal port of the inference path of Breeze TTS 2
by BreezeBlue:

- Code: https://github.com/breezeblue-ai/breeze-tts
- Model: https://huggingface.co/BreezeBlue/Breeze-TTS-2

