CODE THAT FOLLOWS UPSTREAM CODE

The upstream Breeze TTS 2 inference code is licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. Parts of BreezeTTS follow it closely: the four prompt
templates and their segment layout (Sources/BreezeTTS/Text/BreezePrompt.swift,
BreezeRequest.swift), the sampling rules (temperature, top-k, the
repetition penalty, suppressed ids, classifier-free guidance; Engine/Sampling.swift
and the sampling shaders), the generation loop and its stop conditions
(Engine/Synthesis.swift, Engine/FrameLoop.swift), and the network
definitions of the text encoder, backbone and depth decoder (Engine/).
